  <name>PomoTux</name>
  <summary>Lightweight premium Pomodoro timer for Linux</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      PomoTux is a fast, native Pomodoro timer: focus for 25 minutes,
      break for 5, long break after every 4th session. Tasks link to the
      timer, daily goals and streaks track progress, and an optional
      website blocker keeps distractions away during focus.
    </p>
    <p>
      Everything stays on your machine: no accounts, no tracking, with
      JSON export and import for moving between devices.
    </p>
  </description>
